quot;, Dotum, sans-serif, Arial, Gulim, Verdana, &quot;MS Gothic&quot;; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\"></a></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">나. 교육일자: [4차] 10.11.(화)~11.11.(금)</font></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">다. 접수일자: [4차] 08.16.(화)~09.05.(월)</font></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">라. 교육대상: 의료기기 산업에 취업을 희망하는 졸업자 및 졸업예정자(미취업자)</font></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">(졸업예정자의 경우, 마지막 학기에 재학중으로 6개월 이내 취업이 가능한 자.</font></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">단, 특수대학원(취업 및 대학원 진학 병행이 가능하며 수업이 야간, 주말, 계절제(방학), 사이버 등으로 운영)에 재학 중으로 취업 및 교육 수강이 가능한 자는 예외)</font></p><p><font face=\"돋움\">마. 교육방법: 온라인(비대면)</font></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -97pt;\">바. 지원내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">의료기기 전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">全</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">주기 분야 교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(24</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(168h))</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">2) (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">수료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">참여수당</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">(21</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">국가공인 의료기기 규제과학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">(RA)</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">전문가 자격시험 응시자격 부여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">3) (</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">우수학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:11.0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">실무능력 향상을 위한 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">현장실습 및 기업 재직자의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">1:1 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-weight:bold;font-size:11.0pt;\">멘토링제 </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:11.0pt;\">운영</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;font-family:한양중고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:한양중고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">* </span><span style=\"font-family:한양중고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:한양중고딕;\">자세한 교육일정 및 교육내용은 붙임파일 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; line-height: 1.2;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">교육문의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">인재교육본부 교육운영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-family:굴림체;mso-ascii-font-family:굴림체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(02-860-4352)</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><font face=\"돋움\"><br></font></p><div style=\"line-height: 1.2;\"><br></div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
